# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day23

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| retain | 유지하다, 보유하다 | The company hopes to retain skilled employees. |
| implement | 시행하다 | The company implemented a new policy. |
| comply | 준수하다 | Employees must comply with company rules. |
| efficient | 효율적인 | The new system is more efficient. |
| mandatory | 의무적인 | Attendance at the meeting is mandatory. |

